---
/** Shown on draft pages, which only exist in `npm run dev`. */
---

<div class="mb-8 rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-warn bg-[#fdf6e9] px-5 py-3.5 text-small text-muted">
  <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">Draft preview</strong> · Only visible locally. Set
  <code class="font-mono">draft: false</code> in the file's frontmatter to publish it.
</div>
